ou get in that tingle when  you're like oh god i really have to have  this guy that's when you hire not when  you're like i mean i guess this guy  could do the job can't do that it's not  gonna work and then on the flip side  once that person is in if they haven't  closed the deal on that first cycle the  longer i've been doing business the  shorter my tolerance for somebody not  being exceptional is because every  person that has been exceptional i know  immediately and so i just have less and  less time where i think maybe they'll  turn it around maybe some more training  we'll get them there when it's when a  lot of times you win the draft on the  pick and so thank you guys appreciate it  if you're new to mozy nation welcome and  i'll see you guys in the next video bye
 

